    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Agent kill switch\n\nEvaluate a flag before an agent workflow runs. If the flag is off, stop the workflow instead of letting the agent act.\n\nSwap in your own trigger and replace **Rest of your agent workflow** with the real agent steps (AI Agent, tool calls, etc).\n\nWorks on every Unleash plan — only needs a Frontend API token.\n\n**Cache Duration is set to 3 seconds** here, instead of the 30-second default: a kill switch should react quickly, but it still follows the same consistency model as every other flag rather than skipping caching altogether - a few seconds is negligible next to how long it takes a person to act on the change.\n\nUses the [@unleash/n8n-nodes-unleash](https://github.com/Unleash/n8n-nodes-unleash) community node (tested at v0.1.2) for **Evaluate a flag**. It's verified by n8n — install it directly from the canvas on n8n Cloud, or via [Community Nodes](https://docs.n8n.io/integrations/community-nodes/installation-and-management/gui-installation) on a self-hosted instance.",
        "height": 500,
        "width": 320
      },
